# SebatPM role pointers

When the user asks you to act as a role, load the matching portable docs (source of truth — do not duplicate policy in this rule):

| Role | Load |
|------|------|
| Planner | `docs/agents/planner/SYSTEM.md` + `docs/agents/planner/PLAYBOOK.md` |
| Developer | `docs/agents/developer/SYSTEM.md` + `docs/agents/developer/PLAYBOOK.md` |
| Tester | `docs/agents/tester/SYSTEM.md` + `docs/agents/tester/PLAYBOOK.md` |

Also load: `docs/agents/shared-context.md`, `docs/agents/workflow.md`, `docs/product/backlog.md`.

Setup for non-Cursor tools: `docs/agents/README.md`. Index: `AGENTS.md`.
